      <activity id="0e80a2f0-1e2e-5d1b-92cc-7828404e6311" activityNameId="7d395620-979b-513a-bc64-d26142c78688" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Silica sand, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Silica sand, at plant
There is almost no difference from the module "sand, at mine". Some more transportation and energy for drying is added. For the calculation of the additional requirement of conveyor belt the total yearly production of a German company (450'000 tons) and a lifespan of 20 years are used.;
Formula: SiO2; 
UUID: a7511c34-4efb-316c-9d45-3fe6cf13a799
includes the raw material "sand, at plant", a certain additional amount of conveyor belt and the energy for drying the sand. No requirements for administration are included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: typical technology for Swiss production
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature and estimations 
Extrapolations: See geography
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a7511c34-4efb-316c-9d45-3fe6cf13a799.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
